&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using process modeling tools such as Microsoft Visio and/or LucidChart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal training/certifications in Business Process Management (BPM) Business Analysis Body of Knowledge (BABOK), UX/UI principles, enterprise architecture and business architecture frameworks (TOGAF, BIZBOK)&lt;/li&gt;
