&lt;li&gt;Experience with ArcGIS, location-based services, geo-enabled apps, spatial analytics, or similar geospatial technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of IT integration concepts such as databases, web services, webhooks, mobile device configurations, web browsers, IT system architecture concepts&lt;/li&gt;
