&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ArcGIS Spatial Analyst team develops advanced raster analysis capabilities used by organizations worldwide to understand patterns, solve spatial problems, and make better decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a team of engineers who are passionate about turning complex challenges into scalable, high-performance solutions. As a C++ Software Developer, you will contribute to the design and development of next-generation raster analytics that power ArcGIS across desktop and cloud environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in advancing the ArcGIS platform by delivering high-performance, scalable capabilities using modern GPU and cloud computing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform cutting-edge research and advanced concepts into high-performance, scalable analytical tools across key GIS domains, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spatial modeling and suitability analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Terrain and surface analysis (such as intervisibility, geomorphometric)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pattern and density analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistical analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hydrologic analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multidimensional scientific data modeling and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with a collaborative team to conceptualize, design, and deliver innovative GIS solutions that address complex real-world challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and implement robust software components using industry-standard design principles and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify, analyze, and resolve software defects and performance bottlenecks through automated testing and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of demonstrated experience in C++ software development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of algorithms, data structures, and design patterns&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, design, development, and debugging skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with distributed systems, parallel processing, and GPU-accelerated computing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, or a related STEM field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with C# and WPF application development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Agile development methodologies and test-driven development (TDD) practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GIS, raster analysis, and spatial analysis concepts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in mathematics and science, with experience in scientific computing for raster analysis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree or Ph.D. in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, or a related STEM field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
