&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with IDEs, compilers, and development tools for Linux, Windows, macOS , iOS, or Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of 3D graphics, especially Unity or Unreal Engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GIS applications, technologies or concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with OpenGL, DirectX, Vulkan, or Metal&lt;/li&gt;
