&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience working in the conservation, natural resource management, and environmental management disciplines with demonstrated geospatial innovation and advanced use of software technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of GIS and its application within the conservation, natural resource management, and environmental management domains&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated communication skills to include written, verbal, and presentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, self-motivated, and strong ability to multi-task activities with shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong decision-making, problem resolution, and creative thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in GIS, conservation, natural resources, environmental, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree in a GIS, conservation, natural resources, or environmental, geography or related field&lt;/li&gt;
