&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working in the Energy Utility industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of GIS and its application within the Energy Utility domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills to include written, verbal, and presentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, strongly self-motivated, and have the ability to multi-task activities with shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick learner with a positive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong decision-making, problem-resolution, and creative thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in engineering, GIS, geography, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
