&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;. Lead key meetings with business leaders and the HR team. Collaborate with business leaders to interpret business needs and identify talent priorities. Build strong partnerships with HR specialists in the areas of employee relations, talent acquisition, organizational development and training, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
