&lt;li&gt;Proven conflict resolution and negotiation skills, with the ability to manage diverse perspectives and achieve consensus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make data-driven decisions, leveraging analytics to inform business strategies and improve outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
