&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a product or platform through discovery, prioritization, implementation, release readiness, adoption, and sustainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating operational needs into platform configurations, workflows, business rules, or prioritized enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
