&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Technical Consultant, you`ll combine deep ArcGIS expertise with customer consulting skills to understand operational challenges, design geospatial workflows, configure enterprise solutions, and guide customers toward successful implementation and adoption. You`ll operate as a trusted technical resource in a customer embedded environment, working across ArcGIS, enterprise technology, integrations, automation, and secure Defense environments.&lt;/p&gt;
