&lt;li&gt;Configure and optimize ArcGIS capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise customers on platform best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and present complex GIS demonstrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate ArcGIS with enterprise technology environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use scripting and automation to support solution delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate directly with customer IT and mission stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide technical implementation and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
