&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leverage your expertise in Software Asset Management (SAM), enterprise mobility management, vendor management, software licensing, and process optimization to help lead Esri&#39;s Enterprise Software Asset Management and Mobility programs. This role serves as a key leader within IT Service Delivery and is responsible for overseeing software licensing, SaaS governance, AI technology governance, mobility asset management, compliance, software and mobile device lifecycle management, and Configuration Management Database (CMDB) data supporting Esri&#39;s global operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the IT Asset Manager, this position provides strategic and operational leadership for software and mobility asset management, ensuring technology compliance, audit readiness, cost optimization, vendor governance, ServiceNow workflow modernization, and high-quality service delivery across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
