&lt;li&gt;Lead enterprise mobility asset management operations, including mobile device procurement, deployments, lifecycle management, carrier services, inventory governance, and asset accountability for domestic and global offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the operational deputy to the IT Asset Manager, providing leadership, oversight, and decision-making across software and mobility governance, compliance, and service delivery functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage software and mobility asset management staff, including performance management, career development, resource planning, and succession planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce software and mobility lifecycle management standards covering acquisition, deployment, utilization, compliance, optimization, renewals, upgrades, and retirement&lt;/li&gt;
