&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement, Legal, Information Security, Vendor Risk Management, HR, Finance, and business stakeholders to support software, mobility, and technology governance initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technology cost optimization initiatives through software rationalization, license reclamation, utilization reviews, carrier service optimization, subscription management, and vendor consolidation efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee AI software request governance, technology evaluations, privacy assessments, approval workflows, and onboarding processes for emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and enhancement of ServiceNow Software Asset Management capabilities, software request workflows, mobility processes, AI governance procedures, and automation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure software asset repositories, mobility asset inventories, entitlement records, and CMDB data maintain a high degree of accuracy and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct internal and external audit activities while ensuring compliance with corporate policies, contractual obligations, financial controls, and industry standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain asset management metrics, dashboards, operational reporting, and executive presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects involving software licensing, SaaS governance, mobility services, automation, operational improvements, and process modernization&lt;/li&gt;
