&lt;li&gt;2+ years of leadership experience managing technical teams and enterprise technology programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing software licensing, SaaS subscriptions, mobility services, technology compliance, audits, and vendor relationships&lt;/li&gt;
