&lt;li&gt;Proficient in debugging and profiling tools (Eclipse/IntelliJ Debugger, JProfiler, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of working with a source control system, preferably GIT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, design, development, and debugging skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in math, computer science, physics, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
