&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of industry experience in software development using C#&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MVVM and xaml&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for desktop UI/UX development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and deliver quality software in a team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective time management and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in GIS, geography, engineering, computer science, math, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
