&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled Adobe Experience Platform (AEP) Engineer to support, enhance, and scale our existing implementation of Adobe Experience Platform and Real-Time CDP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role focuses on data collection architecture, platform optimization, data quality, and governance across our digital ecosystem. The ideal candidate brings strong hands-on experience with Adobe Experience Platform configuration and management, Customer Journey Analytics(B2B), Adobe Web SDK and Adobe Experience Platform Data Collection, and will play a key role in ensuring reliable data flow, accurate reporting, and scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also collaborate closely across the broader Adobe Experience Cloud ecosystem, including Adobe Experience Manager, Adobe Journey Optimizer, and Adobe Marketo Engage to enable end-to-end customer data activation and insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and support enterprise implementations of Adobe Experience Platform and Real-Time CDP, ensuring scalability, stability, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage end-to-end data collection architecture using Adobe Web SDK, Edge Network, and datastreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and govern XDM schemas, datasets, identity namespaces, and merge policies to ensure accurate profile stitching and audience qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain tagging solutions via Adobe Experience Platform Data Collection across multi-domain environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, troubleshoot and deploy Data Connections and Data Views in CJA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor, troubleshoot, and resolve data ingestion, identity, and cross-platform discrepancies (AEP, Analytics, CJA B2B, downstream systems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data quality frameworks, validation processes, and Query Service-based checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce scalable, event-driven data layer standards (ACDL/EDDL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable audience segmentation and activation, and integrate datasets into Customer Journey Analytics for cross-channel insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and manage consent and privacy frameworks (GDPR, CCPA), including integration with OneTrust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders to translate business requirements into scalable technical solutions; support documentation, governance, and team enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in digital analytics implementation and data collection architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adobe Experience Platform (AEP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AEP Data Collection (Adobe Launch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adobe Web SDK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing or supporting Real-Time CDP solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Customer Journey Analytics (CJA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in JavaScript, HTML, and CSS for web instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with XDM schema design, data modeling, and event-based tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of data layer architecture and governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Agile methodologies and software development lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and cross-functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Incorporate appropriate security and data privacy safeguards into work activities, communications and deliverables to protect sensitive, confidential and regulated information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in information systems, computer science, or a related STEM field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AEP Edge Network and Server-Side Event Forwarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with identity resolution and profile stitching in CDP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Adobe Analytics constructs (eVars, props, events, classifications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AEP with downstream destinations and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AEP with Adobe Journey Optimizer and Adobe Marketo Engage for activation use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with multi-region/global data collection implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python or automation for data validation and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to other tag management systems (GTM, Tealium)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise-scale MarTech ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
