&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of successfully supporting the needs of gathering and designing technical specifications to solve a customer&#39;s needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise software solutions directly and through a channel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in negotiation and strategic engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced story telling skills and experience presenting at conferences and executive level engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn new technology and translate it into solutions that address customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of English and other languages as needed (verbal and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of GIS, Esri technology, and various industries as they relate to one another&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in GIS, business administration, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
