&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree in business administration, legal studies, political science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with federal contracting and large systems integrator terms and conditions&lt;/li&gt;
