&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience incorporating real-time information streams with existing GIS data and IT infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of digitalization strategies that include mobile, IoT, advanced analytics and data science (AI/ML), and imagery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in geography, computer science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Azure or AWS cloud platforms, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
