&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our talented, innovative, and diverse team of collaborative designers and produce a wide range of portfolio-worthy work. Your projects will include print and digital collateral such as large-format event graphics and publication layouts; advertising for print, digital, and social media; motion graphics; presentations; illustrations; and fun promotional items for special events. You will work closely with high-level executives to understand their goals, then strategize to make them come alive. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to collaborate with a team of fellow creatives to inspire, guide, and manage projects to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a creative genius who wants to shape the future of the Esri brand with your brilliant ideas and stunning visuals, you&#39;ve come to the right place. We need someone who knows how to tell a story with images and words. Someone who is not afraid to take risks and experiment with new styles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop visual concepts and designs that tell compelling stories across print, web, events, social media, and other channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with key stakeholders across Esri to understand business needs, shape creative concepts, and translate organizational goals and challenges into effective visual narratives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and oversee the visual style, imagery, and storytelling for key design projects from concept through delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use strong knowledge of the Esri brand and current design practices to improve brand consistency and visual quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve skills with the latest industry trends and design software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior designers and provide clear, constructive creative guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design projects from concept through completion while ensuring quality, brand consistency, and alignment with project goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in graphic design, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio Submission: Please include a link to your online portfolio or samples of recent work. Samples must demonstrate design skills. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience translating business objectives into cohesive visual concepts and narratives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent design skills in layout, composition, typography, and color theory &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop complex, integrated designs and establish visual direction across multiple channels, audiences, and deliverables&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, stakeholder management, and time-management skills, with the ability to articulate and defend creative decisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of design theory, visual storytelling, brand systems, and the technical principles required to achieve impactful visual outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept in interpreting technical information (diagrams, infographics) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing visual direction for integrated or high-profile projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting creative concepts to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Adobe Premiere Pro or After Effects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Adobe Creative Cloud, including Photoshop, InDesign, Illustrator  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to challenge yourself, inspire others, and believe all ideas are welcomed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visa sponsorship is not available for this posting; applicants must be authorized to work for any employer in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in graphic design or similar field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience directing illustration, photography, cartography, or other specialized visual content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Art direction experience with multidisciplinary creative teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing brand systems and visual standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating visual narratives and writing copy for advertising campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with emerging design technologies and AI-assisted tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
