&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a performance-minded marketer who enjoys working across creative, channels, and data? In this role, you will own key aspects of cross-channel campaign activations, performance optimization, and creative execution. You’ll partner closely with channel strategists, creative teams, digital experience, and marketing analytics to bring buyer-aligned campaigns to market through high-quality, integrated activations. Drawing on your experience, you’ll identify opportunities for improvement by monitoring performance signals and uncovering gaps or misalignment. Your insights will inform in-market optimizations and continuous improvement efforts, helping ensure campaigns deliver strong results across channels at Esri.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support and guide development of buyer-aligned paid and owned channel activation strategy in support of awareness, engagement, and demand goals. &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure media and creative tactics align to target personas and stages of the buyer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate activation plans into actionable execution requirements.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain timelines, coordinate asset production, and support timely deployment across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assess in-market activations.&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate execution quality and engagement signals to surface activation insights and support optimization recommendations in partnership with channel strategists and production teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and maintain strong working relationships with cross‑functional stakeholders.&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure activation‑relevant alignment and consistency across media and creative efforts and communicate performance observations and activation insights to support and influence informed decision‑making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Document campaign assessments and best practices to improve repeatability, speed to launch, and performance across future programs.&lt;/strong&gt; Share learnings with channel strategists to inform future activation guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay current on cross-channel and creative best practices.&lt;/strong&gt; Apply relevant learnings to creative evaluation and activation guidance across campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in B2B digital marketing, campaign activation, or performance‑driven marketing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing paid media, email marketing, and integrated digital campaigns from planning to reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret activation and channel‑level performance signals and translate them into actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience collaborating with strategists, creatives, analytics partners, and cross‑functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in marketing, communications, business, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional travel may be required (up to ~20%); travel needs may vary based on business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visa sponsorship is not available for this posting. Applicants must be authorized to work for any employer in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in marketing, business, communications, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting B2B tech marketing campaigns in a matrixed or center‑of‑excellence marketing organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with digital marketing tools such as Marketo, Hubspot, or other related marketing technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with buyer journeys and how creative sequencing supports progression across channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to creative performance reporting and activation insight development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
