&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a strategic contracts leader ready to take your impact to the next level? At Esri, you`ll do more than manage agreements and a team, you will help shape how we deliver innovative geospatial solutions that make a difference around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sr. Principal Contract Specialist, you will manage a team of Contract Specialists as well as lead high-visibility, complex deals. This role will advise leadership on critical business decisions, and mentor the next generation of contract professionals. This is a career-defining opportunity to operate as a trusted advisor and manager while driving meaningful process improvements across a growing, collaborative organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri has a Relocation Assistance Program and can provide support with relocating to the Redlands, CA area for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Esri`s Professional Services Team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Impact: Influence pricing, negotiations, and contract structures that directly support enterprise-level programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership Opportunity: Manage, mentor, and guide a talented contracts team while help elevate overall practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variety &amp;amp; Challenge: Work across commercial, public sector, federal, and international agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative Culture: Partner with legal, finance, and delivery teams in a highly supportive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mission-Driven Work: Contribute to technology that helps organizations solve real-world problems globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor junior and mid-level contract professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full lifecycle of complex services contracts- from RFP through negotiation, execution, and closeout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a strategic advisor to leadership on contract structure, risk mitigation, and pricing strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate and resolve complex contractual issues across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive process improvements and best practices in contract management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support a diverse portfolio of agreements (commercial, public sector, federal, international)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply knowledge of federal contracting frameworks (FAR/DFAR) where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressively complex contract administration experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success negotiating and structuring a variety of agreement types&lt;/li&gt;
