&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re passionate about enterprise software development and GIS analysis, visualization, and integration, this is an exciting opportunity to join Esri. As part of a collaborative development and product engineering team, you’ll help build, test, and enhance innovative mapping and analytics solutions that empower organizations to make smarter, data-driven decisions. We’re looking for motivated GIS professionals who are eager to contribute to impactful cloud and on-premises products used around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
