&lt;p&gt;Seeking a technical professional with strong credentials in Systems Engineering and Cyber Security. You will have the unique opportunity to be part of a team, solving complex problems in a DEVOPS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides technical expertise to design, build, configure, and maintain information systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support systems engineering activities in Windows and Linux environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make recommendations based on knowledge of customer requirements and industry best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with colleagues in a dynamic DevOps environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume lead on assigned projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for providing purchase justifications and project benefit analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasts costs for project related equipment and software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
