&lt;li&gt;Active USG TS SCI security clearance with CI Polygraph&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have working knowledge and experience with ICD 503, NIST 800-53r4/5 controls, NIST 800-171R2, NIST Risk Management Framework, NISPOM Chapter 8, DCSA DAAPM 2.2&lt;/li&gt;
