&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with network storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating the security controls of complex networks and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating routine administrative tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of writing proposals, procedures, and technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organizational, and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
