&lt;li&gt;Expert-level knowledge of design patterns and common usability challenges for enterprise software or data-focused applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience conducting agile UX research and collaborating closely with cross-functional product teams&lt;/li&gt;
