&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 years of experience with web usability, information architecture, and writing for the web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with web analytics tools such as Google Analytics, Adobe Analytics, and Customer Journey Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong listening and communication skills with the ability to work collaboratively and gain consensus on complex projects with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented and highly organized, with the ability to manage multiple priorities effectively in a dynamic, fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively seek professional development opportunities and maintain knowledge of web best practices, including SEO, AEO,UX, and industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in marketing, communications, business, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
