&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to leverage your problem-solving talents and modern front-end development practices to create delightful user experiences for complex workflows.&amp;nbsp; ArcGIS Business Analyst is Esri&#39;s location-based market and community intelligence software that combines demographic, business, lifestyle, and census data with map-based analytics for smart decision-making. Our software helps customers identify the right growth sites and share analysis across their organizations. Join us as part of a dynamic team responsible for designing and developing the next generation of ArcGIS business solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
