&lt;li&gt;Architect solutions working as a TypeScript programmer, writing scalable, reusable, and maintainable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve your language skills in TypeScript by staying current with complementary programming languages, development methodologies, user interface design techniques, and database tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with other developers to develop robust components, integrating with other development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and fix software problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
