&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with additional front-end development technologies (JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Node.JS, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with JavaScript frameworks (such as React, Angular, Ember)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing web components and UI &amp;amp; Unit testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Figma, Storybook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, design, development, and troubleshooting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and experience working with web services / REST APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced and challenging environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent teamwork and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
